{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】律師會舊會址重修後今日(10月13日)啟用，律政司副司長張國鈞會出席儀式。另外，海洋公園明年迎來50周年，今午舉行發布會，將推出一系列全年慶祝活動。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T00:19:56.477671+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T23:43:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T05:38:03.428304+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T00:17:49.890502+00:00","content_hash":"278f50c0b3981172163c6c6704831c05a923f9c51b447494dc5040bc569e5640","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}